      "text": "论节候歌",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c058:p0002",
      "sha256": "55beda0e3ecdc95a5a5c188e96961495e9d24e5d729bcd222c04ea5580615040"
    },
    {
      "section": "论节候歌",
      "text": "正月立春雨水节，二月惊蛰及春分，三月清明并谷雨，四月立夏小满方，",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c058:p0003",
      "sha256": "dfd541d6df259cc6132a5e9311f2f5701e66904a6aa63896829769a1a131cb6b"
    },
    {
      "section": "论节候歌",
      "text": "五月芒种并夏至，六月小暑大暑当，七月立秋还处暑，八月白露秋分忙，",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c058:p0004",
      "sha256": "106ef9f56652f0a1131af39f3ee5148cff17a1e8b510d39359a5e3858d6836db"
    },
    {
      "section": "论节候歌",
      "text": "九月寒露又霜降，十月立冬小雪张，子月大雪冬至节，丑月小寒大寒昌。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c058:p0005",
      "sha256": "923f2c20bfbda82eba95ea385b09d5e06aac7331087d64ce668c1ca9dac5f055"
    },
    {
      "section": "论节候歌",
      "text": "眉批：此以立春日为始，或正月一二三四五六，立春又不问内增二日，只以节义为始，且立春为节，雨水为候，又为节气，逐月仿此。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
